# Scoped ignore for brdgme-go/Dockerfile builds only; takes precedence over the
# root .dockerignore. The Go Dockerfile only COPYs brdgme-go/ and go.mod, so
# everything else is dropped from the context. The Dockerfile and this ignore
# file are always sent regardless.
*
!brdgme-go
!go.mod
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/target
